<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders-for-balance-druid-dps">Shoulders for Balance Druid DPS</h4>We will want to use <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60284/stormriders-shoulderwraps">
<img alt="Stormrider's Shoulderwraps" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stormrider's Shoulderwraps</span></a> for our shoulders. There is no contest here and the only reason you would use others are because you're still gathering <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> to afford <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60284/stormriders-shoulderwraps">
<img alt="Stormrider's Shoulderwraps" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stormrider's Shoulderwraps</span></a>. For that reason I left in the best shoulders from regular dungeons as the options to look for while grinding <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62343/greater-inscription-of-charged-lodestone">
<img alt="Greater Inscription of Charged Lodestone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_bloodstone_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of Charged Lodestone</span></a> requires Exalted reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1171/therazane">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Therazane</span></a>
