<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="chest-for-balance-druid-dps">Chest for Balance Druid DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60281/stormriders-vestment">
<img alt="Stormrider's Vestment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stormrider's Vestment</span></a> is our best option, the only close alternative is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56561/chestguard-of-natures-fury">
<img alt="Chestguard of Nature's Fury" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chestguard of Nature's Fury</span></a>. This one should also be your 2nd purhcase for just points so listing many options here doesn't make sense, if you hit 85 with 4k justice point you can buy this straight away.<br/>
<br/>Keep in mind that when we are 2 weeks into Rage of the Firelands patch (5th november for US, 6th november for EU) our BiS chest piece is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71110/obsidian-arborweave-vestment">
<img alt="Obsidian Arborweave Vestment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_leather_raiddruid_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Obsidian Arborweave Vestment</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Chest Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74250/enchant-chest-peerless-stats">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Peerless Stats</span></a>
