<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wrist-for-balance-druid-dps">Wrist for Balance Druid DPS</h4>Thanks to inferno protocol dungeons, we are no longer extremely limited in getting wrists. We want <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65021/manacles-of-the-sleeping-beast">
<img alt="Manacles of the Sleeping Beast" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Manacles of the Sleeping Beast</span></a>, it's by far our best pre-raid item without spending valor. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69556/armbands-of-the-bear-spirit">
<img alt="Armbands of the Bear Spirit" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Armbands of the Bear Spirit</span></a> is our second best option, but it's in the troll dungeons which we have no real reason to do as they can't be done as inferno protocol. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56297/armbands-of-change">
<img alt="Armbands of Change" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Armbands of Change</span></a> is a decent alternative until you can grab <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65021/manacles-of-the-sleeping-beast">
<img alt="Manacles of the Sleeping Beast" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Manacles of the Sleeping Beast</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Wrist Enchant:</b> <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=96262/enchant-bracer-mighty-intellect">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Mighty Intellect</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=85010/draconic-embossment-intellect">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Draconic Embossment - Intellect</span></a> if <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=165/leatherworking">
<img alt="Leatherworking" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leatherworking</span></a>
