<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="waist-for-balance-druid-dps">Waist for Balance Druid DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65374/gale-rouser-belt">
<img alt="Gale Rouser Belt" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gale Rouser Belt</span></a> is our best belt. It doesn't matter which suffix it gets as they are all stronger than any alternative. But if you are looking for the best possible suffix then they are ranked in the order of: <b>Undertow (Haste and Spirit) &gt; Feverflare (Haste and Mastery) &gt; Wavecrest (Mastery and Spirit) &gt; Fireflash (Haste and Crit)</b>.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70114/fireplume-girdle">
<img alt="Fireplume Girdle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_85v4.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fireplume Girdle</span></a> is our second best belt but requires a lot of progress into the molten front before you can unlock it. Check out <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/guide/molten-front-zone-overview">https://<wbr/>www.wowhead.com/<wbr/>cata/<wbr/>guide/<wbr/>molten-front-zone-overview</a> for a guide to <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5733/molten-front">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Molten Front</span></a>. This is not a recommended option due to how much easier it is to get a better belt, but can be done if you are already farming <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70142/moonwell-chalice">
<img alt="Moonwell Chalice" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_potion_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Moonwell Chalice</span></a>. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56536/lightning-lash">
<img alt="Lightning Lash" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightning Lash</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62420/withered-dream-belt">
<img alt="Withered Dream Belt" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Withered Dream Belt</span></a> (H) /<wbr/> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62431/belt-of-the-untamed">
<img alt="Belt of the Untamed" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of the Untamed</span></a> (A) are both alternatives, they are weaker but can be gained while grinding for a better belt.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65057/belt-of-the-nightmare">
<img alt="Belt of the Nightmare" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of the Nightmare</span></a> is also an option but it makes no sense to ever buy this, as even the worst possible rolled <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65374/gale-rouser-belt">
<img alt="Gale Rouser Belt" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gale Rouser Belt</span></a> will match it, and if you roll anything else it will be better.<div class="markup-table-wrapper">
