<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="feet-for-balance-druid-dps">Feet for Balance Druid DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60236/nightmare-riders-boots">
<img alt="Nightmare Rider's Boots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nightmare Rider's Boots</span></a> is our best possible pre-raid boots. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58484/fading-violet-sandals">
<img alt="Fading Violet Sandals" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fading Violet Sandals</span></a> are our 2nd best pre-raid boots. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69586/two-toed-boots">
<img alt="Two-Toed Boots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_leather_8.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Two-Toed Boots</span></a> is an option if you get lucky and get them, but as with other zandalri gear the downside is you can't farm them while grinding <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a>.<br/>
<br/>When firelands open, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69952/ethereal-footfalls">
<img alt="Ethereal Footfalls" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_leather_raiddruid_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ethereal Footfalls</span></a> are also an option and is one of the are cases where a lower ilvl item is stronger.  They will probably cost quite a bit due to relying on chaos orbs and a recipe that drops from firelands trash.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Feet Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74253/enchant-boots-lavawalker">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Lavawalker</span></a>
<div class="pad"></div>
