<br/>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Balance Druid DPS</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck-for-balance-druid-dps">Neck for Balance Druid DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69882/planetary-amulet">
<img alt="Planetary Amulet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrownnecklaced.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Planetary Amulet</span></a> is the best item to grab and is yet another suffix item. As with other suffix items it does not matter which suffixes the item have, it will beat out the alternatives. The order you want to prioritize the suffixes is: <b>Undertow (Haste and Spirit) &gt; Feverflare (Haste and Mastery) &gt; Wavecrest (Mastery and Spirit) = Flameblaze (Mastery and Hit) &gt; Fireflash (Haste and Crit) = Wildfire (Crit and Hit).</b> Do note that items with hit should be avoided if you sometimes play resto offspec.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70106/nightweavers-amulet">
<img alt="Nightweaver's Amulet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_neck_hyjaldaily_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nightweaver's Amulet</span></a> is our 2nd best neck can be obtained early into molten front and is a super easy early pickup. The rest of the list is just here in case you want options, for example if you don't want to quest through half of mount hyjal and you're looking for an alternative until you can grind out <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69882/planetary-amulet">
<img alt="Planetary Amulet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrownnecklaced.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Planetary Amulet</span></a>. Check <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/guide/molten-front-zone-overview">https://<wbr/>www.wowhead.com/<wbr/>cata/<wbr/>guide/<wbr/>molten-front-zone-overview</a> for a guide to <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5733/molten-front">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Molten Front</span></a> to learn how to get this necklace.<div class="pad"></div>
