<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings-for-balance-druid-dps">Rings for Balance Druid DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65373/planetary-band">
<img alt="Planetary Band" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_87.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Planetary Band</span></a> is our best ring and is the best regardless of which suffix it has.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70124/spirit-fragment-band">
<img alt="Spirit Fragment Band" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_29.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spirit Fragment Band</span></a> is our second best ring. It is however deep in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5733/molten-front">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Molten Front</span></a> and will take time to get, while farming it or if choosing to not farm it, any of the other rings on th elist will do and are listed in approximately descending order. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64904/ring-of-the-boy-emperor">
<img alt="Ring of the Boy Emperor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_ring-of-the-boyemperor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of the Boy Emperor</span></a> is from <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=794/archaeology">
<img alt="Archaeology" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Archaeology</span></a> and if you have staff PTSD you can relax, this one has a much more common rate, the main downside being that you need to already be high enough skill level for tol'vir before you can farm it which will often take longer than the ring grind itself. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67129/signet-of-high-arcanist-savor">
<img alt="Signet of High Arcanist Savor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_pearlring1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of High Arcanist Savor</span></a> is a world drop and very random to get or expensive on the auction house. Besides that there are two justice point options, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58189/twined-band-of-flowers">
<img alt="Twined Band of Flowers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_pearlring1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Twined Band of Flowers</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58188/band-of-secret-names">
<img alt="Band of Secret Names" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_diamondring1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Band of Secret Names</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Ring Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74217/enchant-ring-intellect">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Ring - Intellect</span></a> -  Only Enchanters may apply Ring Enchants on their own rings.<div class="pad"></div>
