<br/>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Balance Druid DPS</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="weapons-for-balance-druid-dps">Weapons for Balance Druid DPS</h4>For pre-raid weapons you will want one of the crafted weapons from Molten Front, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70164/masterwork-elementium-deathblade">
<img alt="Masterwork Elementium Deathblade" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_73.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Masterwork Elementium Deathblade</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70157/lightforged-elementium-hammer">
<img alt="Lightforged Elementium Hammer" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_84.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightforged Elementium Hammer</span></a>. The mace is however stronger. They can be rather pricey though and it is recommended that you get <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62047/darkmoon-card-volcano">
<img alt="Darkmoon Card: Volcano" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_tarot_volcanocard.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Darkmoon Card: Volcano</span></a> first as it will be a bigger upgrade, longer lasting and cheaper. If you do not wish to buy either of the crafted weapons, then <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59341/incineratus">
<img alt="Incineratus" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_bwdraid_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Incineratus</span></a> is your next best alternative. If you have an archaeology staff already from an earlier account, they are bound to account and will serve you well until you get one of the 3 other weapons.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74242/enchant-weapon-power-torrent">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Power Torrent</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
