<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="off-hand-items-for-balance-druid-dps">Off-Hand Items for Balance Druid DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65133/book-of-binding-will">
<img alt="Book of Binding Will" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_book_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Book of Binding Will</span></a> is our best option. This is one of the cases where a lower ilvl item wins out due to the ilvls being close but one having our most preferred offstats and the other our least preferred offstats. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70112/globe-of-moonlight">
<img alt="Globe of Moonlight" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_orb_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Globe of Moonlight</span></a> is the second best offhand but is deep into <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5733/molten-front">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Molten Front</span></a>. Check out <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/guide/molten-front-zone-overview">https://<wbr/>www.wowhead.com/<wbr/>cata/<wbr/>guide/<wbr/>molten-front-zone-overview</a> for a guide to <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5733/molten-front">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Molten Front</span></a>. Your other alternatives are <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67149/heartbound-tome">
<img alt="Heartbound Tome" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_book_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heartbound Tome</span></a> which is a rare world drop, and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=57924/apple-bent-bough">
<img alt="Apple-Bent Bough" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_08.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Apple-Bent Bough</span></a> but this should be a very low priority for your justice points.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Off-Hand Enchant:</b> <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74235/enchant-off-hand-superior-intellect">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Off-Hand - Superior Intellect</span></a>
