<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="relic-for-balance-druid-dps">Relic for Balance Druid DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70111/relic-of-elunes-light">
<img alt="Relic of Elune's Light" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_datacrystal09.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Elune's Light</span></a> is your best relic but is deep into <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5733/molten-front">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Molten Front</span></a>. Before you can get <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70111/relic-of-elunes-light">
<img alt="Relic of Elune's Light" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_datacrystal09.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Elune's Light</span></a> you will want either <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64672/relic-of-norgannon">
<img alt="Relic of Norgannon" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_stonetablet_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Norgannon</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64673/relic-of-eonar">
<img alt="Relic of Eonar" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_elemental_mote_life01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Eonar</span></a> depending on if you need hit.<div class="pad"></div>
