<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="spending-currencies">How to Prioritize Spending Currencies</h3>Pre-BiS gearing in this phase has 3 different currencies to keep track of and prioritize how to spend. <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>, <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> and <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a>. Here I will post some recommendations for each currency to help you during the gearing process. All lists assume that you have roughly equally strong items in all slots.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="justice-points">
<a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a></h4>
<ol>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60285/stormriders-gloves">
<img alt="Stormrider's Gloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stormrider's Gloves</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60281/stormriders-vestment">
<img alt="Stormrider's Vestment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stormrider's Vestment</span></a> - These are the only two important items for Justice Points, the rest are all replaceable</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58189/twined-band-of-flowers">
<img alt="Twined Band of Flowers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_pearlring1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Twined Band of Flowers</span></a> - If you're not grinding molten front for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70124/spirit-fragment-band">
<img alt="Spirit Fragment Band" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_29.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spirit Fragment Band</span></a> and don't want to do <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=794/archaeology">
<img alt="Archaeology" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Archaeology</span></a> for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64904/ring-of-the-boy-emperor">
<img alt="Ring of the Boy Emperor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_ring-of-the-boyemperor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of the Boy Emperor</span></a>, this is your best option</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58183/soul-casket">
<img alt="Soul Casket" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enggizmos_12.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Soul Casket</span></a> - Will help until you have 2 better trinkets</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64672/relic-of-norgannon">
<img alt="Relic of Norgannon" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_stonetablet_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Norgannon</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64673/relic-of-eonar">
<img alt="Relic of Eonar" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_elemental_mote_life01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Eonar</span></a> - If you're not grinding molten front for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70111/relic-of-elunes-light">
<img alt="Relic of Elune's Light" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_datacrystal09.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Elune's Light</span></a> then either of these are your best option until you get all the other important items from valor points. Which depends on if you need hit or not.</div></li></ol>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="fissure-stone-fragment">
<a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a></h4>
<ol>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60284/stormriders-shoulderwraps">
<img alt="Stormrider's Shoulderwraps" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stormrider's Shoulderwraps</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60282/stormriders-cover">
<img alt="Stormrider's Cover" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stormrider's Cover</span></a></div></li>
